NanoKVM TPU add-on

nanokvm-ocr (ocr/nanokvm-ocr.cpp): GPL-3.0-or-later, part of NanoKVM OS.

The TPU runtime (libcviruntime, libcvikernel, model_runner) is Sophgo's
cviruntime and cvikernel as ported to dma-buf heaps in
https://github.com/leafpmpmp/duo-buildroot-sdk-v2 (branch mainline-tpu).
Sophgo's repositories carry no licence file; the source files carry Sophgo
or Cvitek copyright notices. Until Sophgo states a licence, this add-on is
built for testing and not published.

libcnpy: cnpy by Carl Rogers, MIT licence.
libstdc++, libgcc_s: GCC runtime libraries, GPL-3.0 with the GCC Runtime
Library Exception.
flatbuffers (headers, build tool): Apache-2.0.

The OCR models are converted from PaddleOCR (Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR): PP-OCRv6 medium text detection,
PP-OCRv6 small and medium text recognition (output narrowed to Latin
letters) and Cyrillic PP-OCRv5 mobile text recognition (affine blocks folded
into the convolutions), with their dictionaries.
